{"name":"Walrus","hex":"#999b9b","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"walrus","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large Arctic pinniped having long tusks, tough, wrinkled skin, and four flippers, Odobenus rosmarus.","A man with a walrus moustache."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To hunt walruses","To be like a walrus\nTo move dragging one's belly along the floor\n\nTo hang like a walrus's moustache\n\nTo be prominent, like tusks"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/walrus"}],"entries":[{"title":"Walrus","blocks":[{"text":"The walrus is a large pinniped marine mammal with discontinuous distribution about the North Pole in the Arctic Ocean and subarctic seas of the Northern Hemisphere. It is the only extant species in the family Odobenidae and genus Odobenus. This species is subdivided into two subspecies: the Atlantic walrus, which lives in the Atlantic Ocean, and the Pacific walrus, which lives in the Pacific Ocean."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Walrus_in_the_Russian_Arctic_National_Park%2C_Novaya_Zemlya_2015-2.jpg/330px-Walrus_in_the_Russian_Arctic_National_Park%2C_Novaya_Zemlya_2015-2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walrus","wikidata":"Q40994"},{"title":"Walrus (Marvel Comics)","blocks":[{"text":"The Walrus is a comedic supervillain appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. He is the enemy of Spider-Man and Frog-Man."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ec/Walrus_comics.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walrus_(Marvel_Comics)","wikidata":"Q3998685"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Walrus_2_%286383855895%29.jpg/500px-Walrus_2_%286383855895%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wik